{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42428","headline":"题茅山观 · 许坚","name":"题茅山观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常恨清风千载郁，洞天令得恣游遨。\n松楸古色玉坛静，鸾鹤不来青汉高。\n茅氏井寒丹已化，玄宗碑断梦仍劳。\n分明有个长生路，休向红尘叹二毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}